      143.76,
      446.93,
      236.9,
      457.0
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.56,
      467.28,
      310.33,
      525.35
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude* which is required fora public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      79.44,
      536.88,
      293.92,
      546.95
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.56,
      553.68,
      310.34,
      647.75
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total Extent of 0.0023 Hectaresdepicted as Lot No. 118 in Sheet No. 02, Zone No. 10 ofCadastral Map. No. 810039 made by the Surveyor Generalsituated in the Village of Madawalamulla in the Grama NiladhariDivision No. 98A, Madawalamulla North, within MunicipalCouncil Limits, in the Divisional Secretariat, Galle - FourGravets, District of Galle, Southern Province. The details ofthe land are as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.56,
      655.73,
      310.86,
      701.8
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 118 \u2013 Name of the Land: Dinginaidegewatta; LandUse: Home Garden, Permanent Building (Motor Room);Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Couldn't find; Extent :0.0023 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.56,
      426.48,
      562.48,
      448.55
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 119; East: Lot No. 119 and Lot No. 62; South:Lot No. 62 and Lot No. 60; West: Lot No. 60.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.56,
      462.48,
      563.2,
      580.55
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on whichservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Divisional Secretariat, Galle Four Gravets on the 20th day ofNovember, 2019 at 9.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notifyto me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 13th November,2019 the nature of their interests in the land the particulars oftheir claims for compensation and the details of the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details ofthe computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
